{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2a3accaea063c5b2034e3021746828036e5691cc3cbabd138bceba84756b850b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"Read-only operation is enforced by each agent's own CLI, except Antigravity which lacks such a switch and is instead constrained via its plan mode; the user is notified if the tree changes during a run.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_33d6b7b3148a0696b260f02ed4a3f6387f5f9f2933b90c04950ab5b8956c7a4e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"Per the README, read-only enforcement is not uniform: Antigravity's CLI has no read-only switch, so it is held to read-only behavior only through its plan mode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3551f3e984d483d060a6f5956da13eab791355a510486b5a1ab0e5dbb37d6e6e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c","slc_c69a7c6801cff14dc6c01a697535fdc475fd1a254a35f97c0189b2a4c3f53093"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"The design keeps the user inside their own agent, which makes the final call, while the external agents only read the diff; the script is described as the only fixed part of the system.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_396f0a5dc8223be646839082bd6331e6110ab12fb269d66185e7d18ea6ec0e38","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c69a7c6801cff14dc6c01a697535fdc475fd1a254a35f97c0189b2a4c3f53093","slc_d4cc99feba8f2726c0a950c59ea2d80e3c2f98e317e0ca56d2e7d2792a0b6490"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"Installation is prompt-driven: the user pastes a prompt that makes their coding agent create a /postmortemthis skill, downloading the .cmd script once into the skill folder; the repo's SKILL.md is described as a starting point.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4e7e58d859372c706bfc3c119cc90fdf2f6189973539cc8d87ec101a03a2fc16","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a14a50a4f4c7b2623326575cc2aea8300ba2a3b956d811efee5a65437283eecf"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"A `setup` command probes each agent, lets the user log in, force OpenRouter, or disable an agent, optionally fires a test prompt, and saves the choices for later runs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55f18fecfc63c413d6278f1140f7475275a087c0149e918ca865bf38e83a23be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1dbfe0b2005fbefdee6633debc2d0a388e8e9c82481005e118000bc51aa11e5c","slc_d4cc99feba8f2726c0a950c59ea2d80e3c2f98e317e0ca56d2e7d2792a0b6490"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"It runs one prompt across several coding-agent CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, Qwen, Vibe, Grok) in parallel, each reading the current diff.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ce8b38c0e210435c12601f8b2371b8a5b4a9dedfd9d5b0e93d2d447562d3d53","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8b4a037837b5bb65f953ef5f828bda1e2795078cfce2d92cd87e8e7fb93d0a2e"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"Grok is run through an OpenAI-compatible harness against the OpenRouter model x-ai/grok-build-0.1, since Grok's own CLI cannot reach OpenRouter.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5af11315f5cad9e7c39df4a5ffeeae36dd11b5bbacfeb0d37cdc34fffeeb863","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6f37f7dbbab44977c1a380f74490c903c6b23d387a1182ffeb2b808f7e4cd83a"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"The tool depends on the user's installed coding-agent CLIs and their logins; for agents without access, OpenRouter is used via OAuth login or an OPENROUTER_API_KEY, with usage billed to the user's account.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e55ff74319cdb43b20b074a3a5f2c4faa169fa9489f4a8dde42e7f4d88571949","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5ad13d75d45e0add5739f2dc332e025818c1e4f1b3ec78ad54f849f89ead0b89"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"The tool is invoked as a shell script: piping a prompt to `sh postmortemthis.cmd` runs it across all agents, with `setup` and `doctor` subcommands for configuration and availability checks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","created_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ea01a76bb5e758d13ca9c68c8ad398be3e27ce336952d92c21efb7600031f40c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"softeria/postmortemthis@37f38fea5a62 snapshot cd1cf2daf51dc0f0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_378ed7409cc60f4d5b4ebe7722ad5aad85d8246a7ffd58883006f7c3a14c1676"],"source_ids":["src_69067cef4cac5fb5a3bca5618ae26977"],"text":"The product is described as a single small script that installs, updates, and runs all the agents on Windows, macOS, and Linux, with no server or MCP required.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:58Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f37d9a7896a64eafb5bcb3ca5afe1b26"}
